                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 281,
                            "last_played": 1660328244
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The Cat! Porfirio's Adventure is a charming little game that takes you on a whimsical journey through the eyes of a mischievous feline. The game’s hand-drawn art style is adorable and fits perfectly with its lighthearted tone. Exploring the world as Porfirio is genuinely fun, with plenty of quirky interactions and small puzzles that keep you engaged.\n\nHowever, the game does have its rough edges. The controls can feel a bit awkward at times, especially during more precise movements, and the pacing occasionally drags in sections where there isn’t much to do. Despite these minor gripes, the humor and overall charm of the game make it hard to stay mad at it.\n\nIf you’re looking for a relaxing and quirky experience with a lot of personality, The Cat! Porfirio's Adventure is well worth a try. It’s not perfect, but its heartwarming vibe makes it a delightful way to spend an afternoon.",
